  coachNote: "Monday check: farm agreed and mapped, three 30-name lists built, 30-Day Commitment signed. Ask the associate to run the Farm Introduction script on you cold, phone and door, and listen for all six beats, especially the 12-month question. Check the day 3 to 5 sessions: 45 minutes, laptop closed, logged the same day, sheet photographed? Good looks like about 20 geo data and 60 calls, every session in the 18 to 24 band, every no tagged. The one ratio to watch is connections per call. Under 8 from 18 means list quality or time of day, not effort. Connections fine but geo data low means the Collect details beat is being skipped. Fix the right thing."
